{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_30","type":"agent_message","text":"The hole recognizer finds 49 cylindrical holes, including the two side holes, and confirms the Ø100/Ø125 stepped bore. The Z sections show the channel, rail, mounting recesses, and left pockets at distinct levels.\n\nI found one contour refinement: the 133.7° callout implies a short straight tangent between the R70 and R100 curves. I’m adding that segment and the R50 upper blend before the final edge treatment.\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_31","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"build123d","tool":"execute","arguments":{"code":"\n# Fidelity pass: dimensioned common tangent between R70 and R100.\nlower_tangent_angle = math.radians(180-lower_angle)\nlower_tangent_length = (left_lower_edge-(neck_radius+lower_radius)*(1-math.cos(lower_tangent_angle)))/math.sin(lower_tangent_angle)\nlower_end_x_exact = detail_left-(neck_radius+lower_radius)*math.sin(lower_tangent_angle)-lower_tangent_length*math.cos(lower_tangent_angle)\nlower_circle_center = (lower_end_x_exact,lower_radius)\nlower_tangent_low = pt(*lower_circle_center,lower_radius,-math.pi/2+lower_tangent_angle)\nneck_circle_center = (detail_left,left_lower_edge-neck_radius)\nlower_tangent_high = pt(*neck_circle_center,neck_radius,math.pi/2+lower_tangent_angle)\nupper_slope_angle = math.radians(180-upper_angle)\nupper_trim = upper_corner_radius*math.tan(upper_slope_angle/2)\nupper_arc_start = (upper_recess_left+upper_trim*math.cos(upper_slope_angle),overall_width-upper_trim*math.sin(upper_slope_angle))\nupper_arc_end = (upper_recess_left-upper_trim,overall_width)\nupper_arc_center = (upper_arc_end[0],overall_width-upper_corner_radius)\nwith BuildLine() as refined_outline:\n    Line((0,0),(lower_end_x_exact,0))\n    ThreePointArc((lower_end_x_exact,0),pt(*lower_circle_center,lower_radius,-math.pi/2+lower_tangent_angle/2),lower_tangent_low)\n    Line(lower_tangent_low,lower_tangent_high)\n    ThreePointArc(lower_tangent_high,pt(*neck_circle_center,neck_radius,math.pi/2+lower_tangent_angle/2),(detail_left,left_lower_edge))\n    Polyline((detail_left,left_lower_edge),(datum_length-left_bottom_chamfer,left_lower_edge),(datum_length,left_lower_edge+left_bottom_chamfer),(datum_length,left_top-left_top_chamfer),(datum_length-left_top_chamfer,left_top),(upper_break_x,left_top),upper_arc_start)\n    ThreePointArc(upper_arc_start,pt(*upper_arc_center,upper_corner_radius,math.pi/2-upper_slope_angle/2),upper_arc_end)\n    Polyline(upper_arc_end,(0,overall_width),(0,upper_recess_bottom),(-tab_extension,upper_recess_bottom),(-tab_extension,tab_bottom),(0,tab_bottom),(0,0))\nold_blank = extrude(outline_face,amount=overall_thickness).translate((0,0,bottom_z))\nrefined_blank = extrude(Face(Wire(refined_outline.edges())),amount=overall_thickness).translate((0,0,bottom_z))\nall_voids = old_blank - part\npart = refined_blank - all_voids\nprint(\"R70/R100 tangent length\",lower_tangent_length,\"lower tangent endpoint\",lower_end_x_exact)\nshow(part,\"part\")\n"},"result":null,"error":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
